    "reason": "Both full bilingual cases distinguish new H+ secretion from consumption of existing acid. The NCI mechanism supports the stated pump target. Model pH1.921/1.991 and2.222/2.097 agree with supplied ideal amounts/volumes. The result does not imply individual onset, efficacy or treatment selection. Current independently inspected native page, source/prerequisite context and materials support this unchanged complete profile. Frozen first judgment: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-16/chemie-native9-current437-fresh-independent-a-20261016-v1/FIRST.independent-current-nine-science-and-separate699.frozen.json sha256:dbdbefe4b37fa1dc2d314b647d1a275d81715783a9c2b6c76ef17ce846d97d4a",
